{"run_id": "full-r3", "item_id": "reasoning-017", "category": "reasoning", "title": "Sydney call in three other time zones", "difficulty": "hard", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "sol_low", "config_label": "GPT-6.1 Sol (reasoning low)", "model": "gpt-6.1-sol", "reasoning_effort": "low", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 3101, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 175, "reasoning_tokens": 47, "input_tokens": 112, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "answer_chars": 266, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 0, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "pass": true, "expected": "2026-10-29 21:00, 2026-10-30 04:00, 2026-10-30 13:00", "answer_line_found": true, "extracted": "2026-10-29 21:00, 2026-10-30 04:00, 2026-10-30 13:00"}, "workflow_id": "0sfjdf7424c1-d02a-11f1-89ad-1a5d2f4e051b", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfjdf4c0d81-d02a-11f1-ba7a-56adf5b8ca14", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:16:42-0500", "answer": "Sydney is on AEDT (UTC+11), so the call is at 04:00 UTC on October 30.\n\n- Los Angeles (PDT, UTC\u22127): October 29 at 21:00\n- London (GMT, UTC+0): October 30 at 04:00\n- Tokyo (JST, UTC+9): October 30 at 13:00\n\nANSWER: 2026-10-29 21:00, 2026-10-30 04:00, 2026-10-30 13:00"}
{"run_id": "full-r3", "item_id": "reasoning-017", "category": "reasoning", "title": "Sydney call in three other time zones", "difficulty": "hard", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l4_off", "config_label": "Mistral Large 4 (reasoning off)", "model": "mistral-large-4", "reasoning_effort": "none", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 3268, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 468, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 111, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "answer_chars": 1322, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 0, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "pass": true, "expected": "2026-10-29 21:00, 2026-10-30 04:00, 2026-10-30 13:00", "answer_line_found": true, "extracted": "2026-10-29 21:00, 2026-10-30 04:00, 2026-10-30 13:00"}, "workflow_id": "0sfjdf73fdaf-d02a-11f1-89ad-1a5d2f4e051b", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfjdf4c0d81-d02a-11f1-ba7a-56adf5b8ca14", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:16:42-0500", "answer": "I need to find the local times in Los Angeles, London, and Tokyo for a video call at 15:00 on Friday, October 30, 2026, Sydney local time.\n\nFirst, let me establish the time zones for October 30, 2026:\n\n**Sydney, Australia**: October 30, 2026 falls during daylight saving time (AEDT = UTC+11). Sydney observes DST from the first Sunday in October to the first Sunday in April, so October 30 is in AEDT (UTC+11).\n\n**Los Angeles, USA**: October 30, 2026 - DST in the US ends on the first Sunday in November. In 2026, November 1 is the first Sunday, so October 30 is still in PDT (UTC-7).\n\n**London, UK**: October 30, 2026 - BST (British Summer Time) ends on the last Sunday in October. In 2026, October 25 is the last Sunday, so October 30 is in GMT (UTC+0).\n\n**Tokyo, Japan**: Japan does not observe DST, so JST = UTC+9 year-round.\n\nNow converting 15:00 Sydney time (UTC+11) on October 30, 2026:\n\n- **UTC time**: 15:00 - 11 hours = 04:00 UTC on October 30, 2026\n\n**Los Angeles (UTC-7)**:\n04:00 UTC - 7 hours = 21:00 on October 29, 2026 (previous day)\nSo: **2026-10-29 21:00**\n\n**London (UTC+0)**:\n04:00 UTC + 0 hours = 04:00 on October 30, 2026\nSo: **2026-10-30 04:00**\n\n**Tokyo (UTC+9)**:\n04:00 UTC + 9 hours = 13:00 on October 30, 2026\nSo: **2026-10-30 13:00**\n\nANSWER: 2026-10-29 21:00, 2026-10-30 04:00, 2026-10-30 13:00"}
