{"run_id": "full-r3", "item_id": "coding-016", "category": "coding", "title": "Natural sort order", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l4_high", "config_label": "Mistral Large 4 (reasoning high)", "model": "mistral-large-4", "reasoning_effort": "high", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 162381, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 25578, "reasoning_tokens": 25434, "input_tokens": 199, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "answer_chars": 518, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 91864, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "total": 13, "failures": [], "pass": true, "load_error": null, "passed": 13}, "workflow_id": "0sfj31f8c02f-d02c-11f1-9071-46362399c705", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfj30352e83-d02c-11f1-aff9-321d2204384c", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:28:51-0500", "answer": "```python\nimport re\n\ndef _natural_key(s: str) -> tuple:\n    parts = re.findall(r'[0-9]+|[^0-9]+', s)\n    runs = []\n    for part in parts:\n        if '0' <= part[0] <= '9':\n            stripped = part.lstrip('0')\n            if not stripped:\n                stripped = '0'\n            runs.append((0, len(stripped), stripped, len(part)))\n        else:\n            runs.append((1, part.lower()))\n    return (tuple(runs), s)\n\ndef natural_sort(items: list[str]) -> list[str]:\n    return sorted(items, key=_natural_key)\n```"}
