{"run_id": "full-r3", "item_id": "coding-019", "category": "coding", "title": "Earliest common free meeting slot", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l4_high", "config_label": "Mistral Large 4 (reasoning high)", "model": "mistral-large-4", "reasoning_effort": "high", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 173452, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 20527, "reasoning_tokens": 20015, "input_tokens": 250, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "answer_chars": 1789, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 72553, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "total": 15, "failures": [], "pass": true, "load_error": null, "passed": 15}, "workflow_id": "0sfj31a1423c-d02c-11f1-aff9-321d2204384c", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfj30352e85-d02c-11f1-aff9-321d2204384c", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:29:16-0500", "answer": "```python\ndef _parse_time(t: str) -> int:\n    if not isinstance(t, str) or len(t) != 5 or t[2] != \":\":\n        raise ValueError(f\"malformed time: {t!r}\")\n    if any(c not in \"0123456789\" for c in (t[0], t[1], t[3], t[4])):\n        raise ValueError(f\"malformed time: {t!r}\")\n    h = int(t[:2])\n    m = int(t[3:])\n    if h > 23 or m > 59:\n        raise ValueError(f\"malformed time: {t!r}\")\n    return h * 60 + m\n\n\ndef _fmt_time(minutes: int) -> str:\n    return f\"{minutes // 60:02d}:{minutes % 60:02d}\"\n\n\ndef first_common_slot(\n    busy: list[list[tuple[str, str]]],\n    day_start: str,\n    day_end: str,\n    duration_min: int,\n) -> str | None:\n    start = _parse_time(day_start)\n    end = _parse_time(day_end)\n\n    if end <= start:\n        raise ValueError(\"day_end must be after day_start\")\n    if not isinstance(duration_min, int) or duration_min < 1:\n        raise ValueError(\"duration_min must be an integer >= 1\")\n\n    clipped = []\n\n    for person in busy:\n        for s_str, e_str in person:\n            s = _parse_time(s_str)\n            e = _parse_time(e_str)\n\n            if e <= s:\n                raise ValueError(\"busy interval end must be after start\")\n\n            if e <= start or s >= end:\n                continue\n\n            clipped.append((max(s, start), min(e, end)))\n\n    clipped.sort()\n\n    merged = []\n    for s, e in clipped:\n        if not merged or s > merged[-1][1]:\n            merged.append([s, e])\n        else:\n            if e > merged[-1][1]:\n                merged[-1][1] = e\n\n    candidate = start\n\n    for s, e in merged:\n        if candidate + duration_min <= s:\n            return _fmt_time(candidate)\n        if e > candidate:\n            candidate = e\n\n    if candidate + duration_min <= end:\n        return _fmt_time(candidate)\n\n    return None\n```"}
