{"run_id": "full-r3", "item_id": "coding-017", "category": "coding", "title": "LFU cache with LRU tie-break", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l4_high", "config_label": "Mistral Large 4 (reasoning high)", "model": "mistral-large-4", "reasoning_effort": "high", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 210442, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 26130, "reasoning_tokens": 25699, "input_tokens": 262, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "answer_chars": 1785, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 99391, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "total": 12, "failures": [], "pass": true, "load_error": null, "passed": 12}, "workflow_id": "0sfj30ef7e39-d02c-11f1-aff9-321d2204384c", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfj30355598-d02c-11f1-aff9-321d2204384c", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:29:45-0500", "answer": "```python\nfrom collections import OrderedDict, defaultdict\n\ndef lfu_cache(capacity: int, ops: list[tuple]) -> list:\n    if capacity < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"capacity must be non-negative\")\n\n    values = {}\n    freq = {}\n    buckets = defaultdict(OrderedDict)\n    min_freq = 0\n\n    def touch(key):\n        nonlocal min_freq\n        f = freq[key]\n        bucket = buckets[f]\n        del bucket[key]\n        if not bucket:\n            del buckets[f]\n            if min_freq == f:\n                min_freq += 1\n        new_f = f + 1\n        freq[key] = new_f\n        buckets[new_f][key] = None\n\n    def insert(key, value):\n        nonlocal min_freq\n        values[key] = value\n        freq[key] = 1\n        buckets[1][key] = None\n        min_freq = 1\n\n    def evict():\n        bucket = buckets[min_freq]\n        evict_key, _ = bucket.popitem(last=False)\n        if not bucket:\n            del buckets[min_freq]\n        del values[evict_key]\n        del freq[evict_key]\n\n    results = []\n    for op in ops:\n        if not isinstance(op, tuple):\n            raise ValueError(f\"invalid operation: {op!r}\")\n\n        if len(op) == 2 and op[0] == \"get\":\n            key = op[1]\n            if key in values:\n                results.append(values[key])\n                touch(key)\n            else:\n                results.append(None)\n\n        elif len(op) == 3 and op[0] == \"put\":\n            if capacity == 0:\n                continue\n            key, value = op[1], op[2]\n            if key in values:\n                values[key] = value\n                touch(key)\n            else:\n                if len(values) >= capacity:\n                    evict()\n                insert(key, value)\n\n        else:\n            raise ValueError(f\"invalid operation: {op!r}\")\n\n    return results\n```"}
{"run_id": "full-r3", "item_id": "agentic-006", "category": "agentic", "title": "Hold a release that has an open SEV2", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l4_off", "config_label": "Mistral Large 4 (reasoning off)", "model": "mistral-large-4", "reasoning_effort": "none", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 3232, "turns": 3, "retries": null, "usage": {"search_calls": 0, "output_tokens": 325, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 1830, "search_tokens": 0, "cached_input_tokens": 492}, "answer_chars": 943, "finish_reason": null, "thinking_chars": null, "detail": {"final_include_failed": [], "missing_required": [], "pass": true, "forbidden_made": [], "within_max_turns": true, "final_exclude_failed": []}, "workflow_id": "0sfjb688c506-d02c-11f1-9071-46362399c705", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfjb4ded64a-d02c-11f1-aff9-321d2204384c", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:29:53-0500", "answer": "**Promotion blocked \u2014 I did not promote build b-2291.**\n\nSummary of what I did:\n- Found the latest staging build of **billing-api**: **b-2291** (commit 7f3e2c1, built 2026-10-26T11:52:00Z).\n- Verified all required pre-production checks for b-2291: unit-tests, integration-tests, security-scan, and migration-dry-run \u2014 **all passed**.\n- Checked open incidents for billing-api.\n\nWhat is blocking promotion:\n- There is an **open SEV2 incident, INC-7731** (\"Elevated 5xx on invoice generation (eu-west)\", status: investigating, opened 2026-10-26T12:20:00Z). Policy requires no open SEV1/SEV2 incidents before promoting to production.\n\nWhat I deliberately did not do:\n- I did **not** call `promote_build` for b-2291, since the open SEV2 incident blocks promotion even though all build checks passed.\n\nRecommendation: resolve or close INC-7731 first, then re-run the promotion \u2014 b-2291's checks are already green and can be re-verified at that time."}
