{"run_id": "full-r3", "item_id": "agentic-004", "category": "agentic", "title": "Delete only stale unattached volumes, snapshot first", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l4_high", "config_label": "Mistral Large 4 (reasoning high)", "model": "mistral-large-4", "reasoning_effort": "high", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 8248, "turns": 4, "retries": null, "usage": {"search_calls": 0, "output_tokens": 1024, "reasoning_tokens": 441, "input_tokens": 3471, "search_tokens": 0, "cached_input_tokens": 492}, "answer_chars": 907, "finish_reason": null, "thinking_chars": null, "detail": {"final_include_failed": [], "missing_required": [], "pass": true, "forbidden_made": [], "within_max_turns": true, "final_exclude_failed": []}, "workflow_id": "0sfjb5b11559-d02c-11f1-ba7a-56adf5b8ca14", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfjb4ded649-d02c-11f1-aff9-321d2204384c", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:29:58-0500", "answer": "Cleanup complete. Here's the summary for us-east-1:\n\n## Deleted (snapshotted first, then deleted)\n| Volume | Size | Created | Snapshot |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `vol-01a7c3e9` (team: analytics) | 500 GB | 2026-08-02 | `snap-0e71a001` |\n| `vol-05eb0c74` (team: web) | 250 GB | 2026-09-20 | `snap-0e71a005` |\n\nBoth were unattached, older than 30 days, and not tagged keep=true.\n\n## Left alone\n- **`vol-02b8d4f1`** \u2014 attached to instance `i-0f3a91c2` (state: in-use)\n- **`vol-03c9e5a2`** \u2014 available but only ~12 days old (created 2026-10-14), under the 30-day threshold\n- **`vol-04dafb63`** \u2014 available and old enough, but tagged `keep=true` (explicitly protected)\n- **`vol-06fc1d85`** \u2014 available but only ~26 days old (created 2026-09-30), under the 30-day threshold\n\nThis removes 750 GB of orphaned storage (~$75/month at typical gp3 pricing). Want me to check the other regions (us-west-2, eu-west-1) as well?"}
