{"run_id": "full-r3", "item_id": "agentic-008", "category": "agentic", "title": "Triage a failed pipeline run", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l4_off", "config_label": "Mistral Large 4 (reasoning off)", "model": "mistral-large-4", "reasoning_effort": "none", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 6026, "turns": 4, "retries": null, "usage": {"search_calls": 0, "output_tokens": 592, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4000, "search_tokens": 0, "cached_input_tokens": 1968}, "answer_chars": 798, "finish_reason": null, "thinking_chars": null, "detail": {"final_include_failed": [], "missing_required": [], "pass": true, "forbidden_made": [], "within_max_turns": true, "final_exclude_failed": []}, "workflow_id": "0sfjb769d670-d02c-11f1-9071-46362399c705", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfjb4ded64c-d02c-11f1-aff9-321d2204384c", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:29:58-0500", "answer": "Triage complete for `nightly_sales` run `2026-10-25`:\n\n**Re-ran:**\n- `extract_returns` (sales-data-eng) \u2014 failed with a transient S3 `ReadTimeoutError` after 3 tries; re-queued as try 4.\n\n**Tickets opened:**\n- **DATA-4417** to **analytics-eng** \u2014 `transform_sales` failed with a `SchemaValidationError` (column `discount_pct` expected DECIMAL(5,2), got STRING in 1,204 rows, e.g. `'12.5%'`). Not re-run per policy since it's a schema/data issue, not transient.\n\n**Left alone (upstream_failed):**\n- `returns_rollup` (analytics-eng) \u2014 blocked by `extract_returns`; will run once the re-run succeeds.\n- `load_warehouse` (data-platform) and `publish_dashboard` (bi-team) \u2014 blocked by downstream failures; note `load_warehouse` will still be blocked by `transform_sales` until the schema issue is fixed."}
