{"run_id": "full-r3", "item_id": "your_data-001", "category": "your_data", "title": "SEV-1 status page cadence", "difficulty": "easy", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l4_off", "config_label": "Mistral Large 4 (reasoning off)", "model": "mistral-large-4", "reasoning_effort": "none", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 1426, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 47, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4139, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 3564}, "answer_chars": 176, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 0, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "pass": true, "judge_usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 67, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4352, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 4349}, "programmatic": {"missing_facts": [], "pass": true}, "judge": {"score": 5, "reason": "The answer correctly gives the SEV-1 status update deadline of 20 minutes from declaration and a subsequent cadence of every 30 minutes until resolved, as specified in section 2.1.", "correct": true, "parsed": true, "hallucinations": [], "faithful": true}}, "workflow_id": "0sfj2efe5f34-d02d-11f1-89ad-1a5d2f4e051b", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfj2eef3a4f-d02d-11f1-9071-46362399c705", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:33:15-0500", "answer": "Per the handbook (section 2.1), for a SEV-1:\n\n- **First status page update**: within **20 minutes of declaration**\n- **Subsequent updates**: **every 30 minutes** until resolved"}
{"run_id": "full-r3", "item_id": "your_data-003", "category": "your_data", "title": "Platinum downtime budget", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l3", "config_label": "Mistral Large 3 (baseline)", "model": "mistral-large-2512", "reasoning_effort": null, "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 1788, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 104, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4312, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "answer_chars": 315, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 0, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "pass": true, "judge_usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 74, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4455, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "programmatic": {"missing_facts": [], "pass": true}, "judge": {"score": 5, "reason": "The answer correctly calculates 21.6 minutes of allowed downtime and states the 10% and 25% credits, though its wording omits the exact 99.0% boundary where the 10% credit still applies.", "correct": true, "parsed": true, "hallucinations": [], "faithful": true}}, "workflow_id": "0sfj2f14afc5-d02d-11f1-ba7a-56adf5b8ca14", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfj2eef3a50-d02d-11f1-9071-46362399c705", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:33:16-0500", "answer": "For a Platinum customer in a 30-day month:\n\n- **Allowed downtime before service credit**: 21.6 minutes (0.05% of 30 days).\n- **Service credit if monthly uptime falls below 99.95% but remains above 99.0%**: 10% of that month's fees.\n- **Service credit if monthly uptime falls below 99.0%**: 25% of that month's fees."}
{"run_id": "full-r3", "item_id": "your_data-001", "category": "your_data", "title": "SEV-1 status page cadence", "difficulty": "easy", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l3", "config_label": "Mistral Large 3 (baseline)", "model": "mistral-large-2512", "reasoning_effort": null, "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 1073, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 41, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4308, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 4224}, "answer_chars": 164, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 0, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "pass": true, "judge_usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 56, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4342, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 4339}, "programmatic": {"missing_facts": [], "pass": true}, "judge": {"score": 5, "reason": "The answer correctly states the SEV-1 status page deadlines: within 20 minutes of declaration and every 30 minutes thereafter until resolved.", "correct": true, "parsed": true, "hallucinations": [], "faithful": true}}, "workflow_id": "0sfj2efe5f38-d02d-11f1-89ad-1a5d2f4e051b", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfj2eef3a4f-d02d-11f1-9071-46362399c705", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:33:16-0500", "answer": "The first status page update must go out **within 20 minutes of declaration**. After that, updates must be posted **every 30 minutes until resolved** (Section 2.1)."}
{"run_id": "full-r3", "item_id": "your_data-003", "category": "your_data", "title": "Platinum downtime budget", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l4_off", "config_label": "Mistral Large 4 (reasoning off)", "model": "mistral-large-4", "reasoning_effort": "none", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 2252, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 152, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4143, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 4076}, "answer_chars": 538, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 0, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "pass": true, "judge_usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 61, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4509, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "programmatic": {"missing_facts": [], "pass": true}, "judge": {"score": 5, "reason": "The answer correctly calculates 21.6 minutes of allowed downtime, states the 10% and 25% credit thresholds, and accurately includes the credit request deadline.", "correct": true, "parsed": true, "hallucinations": [], "faithful": true}}, "workflow_id": "0sfj2f14afc3-d02d-11f1-ba7a-56adf5b8ca14", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfj2eef3a50-d02d-11f1-9071-46362399c705", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:33:16-0500", "answer": "Based on section 8.2 and 8.3 of the handbook:\n\n**Platinum uptime commitment: 99.95% per calendar month**\n\nIn a 30-day month (43,200 minutes), that allows **21.6 minutes** of API downtime before the commitment is breached (43,200 \u00d7 0.0005 = 21.6 minutes).\n\n**Service credit if missed:** 10% of that month's fees. If monthly uptime falls below 99.0% (i.e., more than ~432 minutes of downtime), the credit increases to **25%** of that month's fees.\n\nNote: the customer must request the credit within 30 days of the end of the affected month."}
{"run_id": "full-r3", "item_id": "your_data-003", "category": "your_data", "title": "Platinum downtime budget", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "sol_low", "config_label": "GPT-6.1 Sol (reasoning low)", "model": "gpt-6.1-sol", "reasoning_effort": "low", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 2529, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 127, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4085, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 4082}, "answer_chars": 498, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 0, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "pass": true, "judge_usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 56, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4488, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "programmatic": {"missing_facts": [], "pass": true}, "judge": {"score": 5, "reason": "The answer correctly calculates the Platinum downtime thresholds and credit amounts, and its additional request deadline and contract-precedence statements are supported by the handbook.", "correct": true, "parsed": true, "hallucinations": [], "faithful": true}}, "workflow_id": "0sfj2f14afc4-d02d-11f1-ba7a-56adf5b8ca14", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfj2eef3a50-d02d-11f1-9071-46362399c705", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:33:16-0500", "answer": "For a Platinum customer, the monthly API uptime commitment is **99.95%**. In a 30-day month (43,200 minutes), that allows **21.6 minutes of downtime** before uptime falls below the commitment.\n\n- **More than 21.6 minutes:** credit of **10% of that month\u2019s fees**.\n- **More than 432 minutes** (uptime below 99.0%): credit of **25% of that month\u2019s fees**.\n\nCustomers must request credits within **30 days after the affected month ends**. A signed customer contract takes precedence over the handbook."}
{"run_id": "full-r3", "item_id": "your_data-002", "category": "your_data", "title": "Escalating an unmitigated API error spike", "difficulty": "hard", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l3", "config_label": "Mistral Large 3 (baseline)", "model": "mistral-large-2512", "reasoning_effort": null, "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 2473, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 149, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4320, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "answer_chars": 559, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 0, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "pass": true, "judge_usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 75, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4609, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "programmatic": {"missing_facts": [], "pass": true}, "judge": {"score": 5, "reason": "The answer correctly identifies SEV-2, includes primary and Tier 2 service-owner paging, and states both Director of Reliability escalation triggers with the proper declaration-to-resolution timing.", "correct": true, "parsed": true, "hallucinations": [], "faithful": true}}, "workflow_id": "0sfj2f418c38-d02d-11f1-ba7a-56adf5b8ca14", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfj2eef3a51-d02d-11f1-9071-46362399c705", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:33:17-0500", "answer": "Based on the document:\n\n- **Who should have been paged by now**:\n  - The **on-call primary** (and secondary as backup) at declaration (SEV-2).\n  - The **service owner** (Tier 2) after 45 minutes of no mitigation (which has now passed).\n  - The **Incident Commander (IC)** must be assigned within 30 minutes of declaration.\n\n- **What would escalate this to the Director of Reliability (Tier 3)**:\n  - If the SEV-2 incident lasts **more than 3 hours** from declaration without resolution.\n  - Or if this is the **third SEV-2 on the same service within 7 days**."}
{"run_id": "full-r3", "item_id": "your_data-007", "category": "your_data", "title": "Postmortem draft vs customer RCA deadlines", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l3", "config_label": "Mistral Large 3 (baseline)", "model": "mistral-large-2512", "reasoning_effort": null, "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 852, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 40, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4304, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 4224}, "answer_chars": 175, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 0, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "pass": true, "judge_usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 64, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4368, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "programmatic": {"missing_facts": [], "pass": true}, "judge": {"score": 5, "reason": "The answer correctly states both deadlines measured from resolution: 3 business days for the internal postmortem draft and 5 business days for the SEV-1 customer-facing RCA.", "correct": true, "parsed": true, "hallucinations": [], "faithful": true}}, "workflow_id": "0sfj30bd4d85-d02d-11f1-89ad-1a5d2f4e051b", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfj2eef6166-d02d-11f1-9071-46362399c705", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:33:17-0500", "answer": "The internal postmortem draft is due within **3 business days** of resolution.\n\nThe customer-facing RCA must be published within **5 business days** of resolution for a SEV-1."}
