{"run_id": "full-r3", "item_id": "your_data-002", "category": "your_data", "title": "Escalating an unmitigated API error spike", "difficulty": "hard", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "sol_low", "config_label": "GPT-6.1 Sol (reasoning low)", "model": "gpt-6.1-sol", "reasoning_effort": "low", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 3196, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 164, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4092, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 4089}, "answer_chars": 681, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 0, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "pass": true, "judge_usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 65, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4625, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "programmatic": {"missing_facts": [], "pass": true}, "judge": {"score": 5, "reason": "The answer correctly identifies SEV-2, gives the primary and service-owner paging requirements and both Director escalation triggers, and appropriately clarifies that thresholds run from declaration rather than symptom onset.", "correct": true, "parsed": true, "hallucinations": [], "faithful": true}}, "workflow_id": "0sfj2f418c39-d02d-11f1-ba7a-56adf5b8ca14", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfj2eef3a51-d02d-11f1-9071-46362399c705", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:33:17-0500", "answer": "This meets **SEV-2** criteria: API errors above 5% for 10 consecutive minutes.\n\nEscalation clocks run from **declaration**, not from when errors started. By now:\n- **On-call primary:** paged at declaration. Beacon pages the secondary if the primary hasn\u2019t acknowledged within 15 minutes.\n- **Owning team\u2019s service owner:** paged if there\u2019s still no mitigation **45 minutes after declaration**. Whether that deadline has passed depends on when you declared.\n\nPage the **Director of Reliability** if either:\n- The SEV-2 lasts **more than 3 hours from declaration to resolution**\u2014mitigation does not stop that clock; or\n- This is the **third SEV-2 on the same service within 7 days**."}
{"run_id": "full-r3", "item_id": "your_data-007", "category": "your_data", "title": "Postmortem draft vs customer RCA deadlines", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "sol_high", "config_label": "GPT-6.1 Sol (reasoning high)", "model": "gpt-6.1-sol", "reasoning_effort": "high", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 1488, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 53, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4079, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 4076}, "answer_chars": 226, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 0, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "pass": true, "judge_usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 47, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4379, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "programmatic": {"missing_facts": [], "pass": true}, "judge": {"score": 5, "reason": "The answer correctly gives both SEV-1 deadlines measured from resolution and accurately defines business days.", "correct": true, "parsed": true, "hallucinations": [], "faithful": true}}, "workflow_id": "0sfj30bd4d84-d02d-11f1-89ad-1a5d2f4e051b", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfj2eef6166-d02d-11f1-9071-46362399c705", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:33:18-0500", "answer": "Both deadlines run from **resolution**:\n- **Internal postmortem draft:** within **3 business days**.\n- **Customer-facing RCA:** within **5 business days**.\n\nBusiness days are Monday\u2013Friday, excluding Ferngate company holidays."}
