{"run_id": "full-r3", "item_id": "your_data-009", "category": "your_data", "title": "Weekly on-call pay with extra pages", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l3", "config_label": "Mistral Large 3 (baseline)", "model": "mistral-large-2512", "reasoning_effort": null, "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 1638, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 116, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4302, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 4224}, "answer_chars": 358, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 0, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "pass": true, "judge_usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 59, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4398, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "programmatic": {"missing_facts": [], "pass": true}, "judge": {"score": 5, "reason": "The answer correctly calculates $810 from the $450 primary stipend plus three additional pages at $120 each, and its submission instructions are supported by the handbook.", "correct": true, "parsed": true, "hallucinations": [], "faithful": true}}, "workflow_id": "0sfj3e8aaaac-d02d-11f1-ba7a-56adf5b8ca14", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfj3de82e34-d02d-11f1-aff9-321d2204384c", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:33:41-0500", "answer": "For your on-call week as primary with **8 out-of-hours pages**, your compensation will be:\n\n- **Weekly stipend**: $450 (covers the first 5 out-of-hours pages).\n- **Page pay**: $120 \u00d7 3 (for the 3 additional out-of-hours pages) = **$360**.\n\n**Total**: $450 + $360 = **$810**. Submit via the payroll on-call form by the 3rd business day of the following month."}
